    "name": "Cat Slaps",
    "steam_appid": 3445100,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445100/extras/878caac5c37aef775ab7b85e82470c83.poster.avif?t=1755533068\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445100/extras/878caac5c37aef775ab7b85e82470c83.webm?t=1755533068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445100/extras/878caac5c37aef775ab7b85e82470c83.mp4?t=1755533068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Cat Slaps is a fun and entertaining game born from the joy cats get from slapping objects. Use your paw to knock objects around and off tables in this delightful chaos! All you need is a keyboard to leap from table to table and a mouse to send objects tumbling to the floor. But is it just about slapping objects? No way!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DETAILED GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Procedural Generation: No two table top disasters are the same!<br></li><li>3D Physics Based Platforming: Jump, land, and slap with real physics, just like a true troublemaking cat.<br></li><li>Permadeath Roguelike: Nine lives? Think again! Stay on the table or start over<br></li><li>Object Cards: Choose wisely and shape your world with absurdly fun objects.<br></li><li>Crafting Cards: Combine objects and modifiers for purrfectly unpredictable effects!<br></li><li>Customization: Style your paws, because even chaos needs a personal touch.<br></li><li>Claws: Scratch and claw at objects to interact in new ways, because what\u2019s a cat without claws?<br></li><li>High-Score System: The messier, the better. Can you become the ultimate chaos champion?</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT'S IN THE DEMO?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83d\udc3e Limited paw customization.<br></li><li>\ud83c\udccf Object and crafting cards.<br></li><li>\u2694\ufe0f Constrained mechanics.<br></li><li>\ud83d\ude3aTiny claws.<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfb2 A variety of objects to slap.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT'S IN THE UPCOMING FULL RELEASE?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83c\udfa8 Full customization for your cat\u2019s paws and appearance.<br></li><li>\ud83c\udccf Wide spectrum object and crafting cards with new unique effects!<br></li><li>\u2694\ufe0f New mechanics and interactions.<br></li><li>\ud83d\ude3c Functional tiny claws, sharper and more mischievous than ever!<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfb2 A much wider variety of objects to slap, knock over, and interact with.</li></ul></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445100/extras/8edf4349d2f8e02eb6192c608bf7580c.poster.avif?t=1755533068\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445100/extras/8edf4349d2f8e02eb6192c608bf7580c.webm?t=1755533068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445100/extras/8edf4349d2f8e02eb6192c608bf7580c.mp4?t=1755533068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2>Chubby paws customization is important! In the demo, your paw-shaping options are limited, but after the demo, a more feature-rich and fun character creation screen awaits you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445100/extras/b07bf2f23b4fe2a13156763e0b1e1152.poster.avif?t=1755533068\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445100/extras/b07bf2f23b4fe2a13156763e0b1e1152.webm?t=1755533068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445100/extras/b07bf2f23b4fe2a13156763e0b1e1152.mp4?t=1755533068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFTING</strong></h2>Create different objects with new unique card combinations. Then, slap them too! Find out which new and different features work best for you. Of course, the full version will bring even more objects with updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445100/extras/81d4e2ca816131b5190fdcbc3869b4ab.poster.avif?t=1755533068\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445100/extras/81d4e2ca816131b5190fdcbc3869b4ab.webm?t=1755533068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445100/extras/81d4e2ca816131b5190fdcbc3869b4ab.mp4?t=1755533068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A FRIEND</strong></h2>Oh, and this is Mr. Orange, the Card Trader.</p>",
